meta {
  name: 62 Master Data Import Sync - Duplicate Links (E2E)
  seq: 62
}

docs {
  Two branch tests linked to the SAME tenant test can't be produced through the
  API, so this case needs a DB fixture between runs:

    1. bru run "61 Master Data Import Sync (E2E)" ... --env-var e2eStateFile=/tmp/md-import-e2e.json
    2. psql "$TEST_DB_URL" -v bmd=<branchMdId> -v src=<tenantIds.B> \
         -f bruno/lib/md-import-duplicate-link-fixture.sql
    3. bru run "62 Master Data Import Sync - Duplicate Links (E2E)" ... --env-var e2eStateFile=/tmp/md-import-e2e.json
}
